{"id":"9331b22006d4e290","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-desc-universal-analytic-set.md","title":"ZFC Desc Universal Analytic Set","display":"df-zfc-desc-universal-analytic-set — ZFC Desc Universal Analytic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-desc-universal-analytic-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-desc-universal-analytic-set","58-df-zfc-descriptive2-universal-analytic-set"],"display":"df-zfc-desc-universal-analytic-set — ZFC Desc Universal Analytic Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-desc-universal-analytic-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-desc-universal-analytic-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-universal-analytic-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-desc-universal-analytic-set — ZFC Desc Universal Analytic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"266bdc015ee47b22\" href=\"?note=266bdc015ee47b22\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,X\\in V\">\\(U,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (analytic-set predicate on Baire space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"266bdc015ee47b22\" href=\"?note=266bdc015ee47b22\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescUniversalAnalyticSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2UniversalAnalyticSet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescUniversalAnalyticSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2UniversalAnalyticSet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}universal\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescUniversalAnalyticSet}_S(U,X)\\leftrightarrow X=\\omega^\\omega\\land U\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\times X\\land\\exists J\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\omega^\\omega\\times X,\\omega^\\omega)\\land\\forall p,x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(J(\\langle p,x\\rangle)(2n)=p(n)\\land J(\\langle p,x\\rangle)(2n+1)=x(n))\\land\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(J[U])\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(A=\\{x\\in X:\\langle p,x\\rangle\\in U\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}universal\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescUniversalAnalyticSet}_S(U,X)\\leftrightarrow X=\\omega^\\omega\\land U\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\times X\\land\\exists J\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\omega^\\omega\\times X,\\omega^\\omega)\\land\\forall p,x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(J(\\langle p,x\\rangle)(2n)=p(n)\\land J(\\langle p,x\\rangle)(2n+1)=x(n))\\land\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(J[U])\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{AnalyticSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(A=\\{x\\in X:\\langle p,x\\rangle\\in U\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}universal\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2UniversalAnalyticSet}_S(U,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescUniversalAnalyticSet}_S(U,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}universal\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2UniversalAnalyticSet}_S(U,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescUniversalAnalyticSet}_S(U,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-universal-analytic-set</code> is merged here; its section notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_p\">\\(U_p\\)</span> denotes the same universal analytic family.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"266bdc015ee47b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-analytic-set.md]]",